37
00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:47.330
Yuval's work is defined by his ability to see things clearly

38
00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.110
with a distance and objectivity that provides room

39
00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:54.720
to explore big ideas and find compelling insights.

40
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.000
Insights into problems like disinformation and distraction,

41
