the potential of AI to make work irrelevant,

42
00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.778
the problems with education,

43
00:02:04.778 --> 00:02:08.020
and the growing importance of developing emotional

44
00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.470
and professional flexibility and resilience.

45
00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:14.420
It was truly an honor to spend an hour

46
00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:17.450
